  "solution": {
    "text": "PCC oxidizes primary alcohols to aldehydes and secondary alcohols to ketones. In the above reaction, $-\\mathrm{OCOCH}_3$ group is hydrolyzed to secondary alcohol which is then oxidised (with PCC) to ketone.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/66X9UgV841OAOmjVsJtRKrEunek4_hx9QfBXqxFszyk.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/OOLq4pp8pW8f9gUbEIh6JzRECku20bdFQg1xT5sJQUs.rendered.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
